          <li>Chris Staton, <a href="https://www.shutoffnotice.com/">Shut Off Notice Records</a> - Providing Reel to Reel digitization services.</li>
          <li><a href="http://www.hc7seadevils.org/">HC7 Sea Devils</a> - Providing historical context and research materials.</li>
